  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 21.3333339691162px;\">Ribesalbes ha iniciado este viernes sus fiestas de una manera solemne, con la proclamaci&oacute;n como Reina 2014 de Ana Bachero Arzo , que sucede en el cargo a&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21.3333339691162px;\">Carmen Vicent Corella</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 21.3333339691162px;\">. La Corte de Honor est&aacute; formada por Marta Garc&iacute;a Talaya y Claudia Merenciano Salvador.</span></span></span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinaribesalbes14/img_4792.jpg\" alt=\"img_4792\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinaribesalbes14/img_4793.jpg\" alt=\"img_4793\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinaribesalbes14/img_4794.jpg\" alt=\"img_4794\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinaribesalbes14/img_4795.jpg\" alt=\"img_4795\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinaribesalbes14/img_4797.jpg\" alt=\"img_4797\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinaribesalbes14/img_4799.jpg\" alt=\"img_4799\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinaribesalbes14/img_4800.jpg\" alt=\"img_4800\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;